        "Web source 1",
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mulino%2C_Oregon"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The Mulino post office was established in 1882 and operated out of the oldest continuous post office building in the area.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
